<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-ABN Amro starts aluminum companies.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-ABN Amro starts aluminum companies.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO/Chicago Corp said Monday it initiated coverage of several aluminum companies.</p>
<p>Aluminum Co of America and Alumax Inc were started with a buy rating, Kaiser Aluminum Corp with a speculative buy. Reynolds Metals Co and Alcan Aluminum Ltd were initiated with a hold rating.</p>
<p>Coverage of the companies was initiated by analysts Vahid Fathi and Todd Hinrichs.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
